# Dashboard Hierarchical Filtering and Categorized Overview

The dashboard needs to be updated to support filtering by Activity and Division, and to provide a new overview of emissions categorized by these hierarchical levels.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend (server.js)

#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/server.js)
- Update `GET /api/dashboard/summary` to support `activity` and `division` query parameters.
- Join the `emissions` table with the `facilities` table to filter by these new fields.
- Create a NEW endpoint `GET /api/dashboard/categorical-breakdown` that returns emissions grouped by Activity and Division for the selected year range.

